WEBVTT

00:12:58.364 --> 00:13:02.826
someone listening to that might say,
"That's a little bit terrifying.

00:13:02.850 --> 00:13:05.561
I'm supposed to run my life
through commitments,

00:13:05.585 --> 00:13:06.877
but how do I choose them?"

00:13:06.901 --> 00:13:08.569
A commitment is a scary thing.

00:13:08.593 --> 00:13:12.771
It's going to control my life
for the next years,

00:13:12.795 --> 00:13:18.178
certainly at the level of
to marry someone, commit to a career ...

00:13:18.202 --> 00:13:23.184
So how does someone get to the point
of knowing what to commit to?

00:13:23.208 --> 00:13:25.126
DB: Well, the choosing is the hard part,

00:13:25.150 --> 00:13:27.371
and then the executing
is the second hard part.

00:13:27.395 --> 00:13:30.256
We have acquired human wisdom
on these questions.